Provenance
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Substantial parts of this program are adapted from wildberries-monitor
(github.com/BlankTrail/wildberries-monitor), by the same copyright holder and
under the same licence: the rules engine, the change tracker, the exporters, the
chart drawing, the event bus, the autostart entries, the icon generator, the
notification outbox and the shape of the web panel. The `blanktrail` package is
copied from that project unmodified except for two additive extensions, and it
remains neutral about the site it is pointed at — a test enforces that.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Captured pages under docs/measurements/fixtures/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Pages retrieved from avito.ru on 2026-08-23 and kept so that the parser can be
tested without touching the network. They are the evidence the design rests on.
They contain third-party personal data — seller display names, addresses and
house-precision coordinates — and MUST be scrubbed before this repository is
published. See docs/measurements/fixtures/README.md.
